OL,3,GNEWSA'To lose two leaders is careless'
OL,4,A- Wilde takes on Nesbitt v Burrows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dramatic evening exit and a vacant
OL,7,Fposition as Stormont's health minister
OL,8,F- the resignation of Mike Nesbitt has
OL,9,Fprovided no shortage of political
OL,10,Freaction.
OL,12,FThe move came on Tuesday, amid a clash
OL,13,Fover withdrawing emergency general
OL,14,Fsurgery services from Causeway
OL,15,FHospital, with the UUP leader Jon
OL,16,FBurrows.
OL,18,FBBC News NI's Political and Health
OL,19,FCorrespondents Gareth Gordon and
OL,20,FMarie-Louise Connolly provide some
OL,21,Fanalysis on how it all played out and
OL,22,Fwhat's next.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
