OL,3,GNEWSA'To lose two leaders is careless'
OL,4,A- Wilde takes on Nesbitt v Burrows
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith apologies to Oscar Wilde, to lose
OL,7,Fone former party leader is unfortunate
OL,8,Fto lose two is careless.
